control: The scheduler refuses a plan it could never run, and the refusal stops the process in order naming the job kind
removes: the job kinds' plans are ensured only once the process serves, so a plan the scheduler refuses fails a process that has already announced it serves
packages: ./process
tests: TestASchedulerThatRefusesAPlanStopsTheProcessInOrder
scheduled-count: no

